# 必考词 Unit 27 短语

## 常考短语

- **gain access to**: 获得对…的访问 — Students can gain access to online resources. 学生可以获得在线资源的访问权。
- **in accordance with**: 按照 — The work was done in accordance with the regulations. 工作按照规定完成。
- **take...into account**: 考虑到 — We must take all factors into account. 我们必须考虑所有因素。
- **on account of**: 由于 — The game was cancelled on account of rain. 由于下雨，比赛被取消了。
- **be accurate in**: 在…方面准确 — The report is accurate in its findings. 报告的发现是准确的。
- **acquire knowledge**: 获取知识 — Reading is a good way to acquire knowledge. 阅读是获取知识的好方法。
- **adapt to**: 适应 — It takes time to adapt to a new environment. 适应新环境需要时间。
- **adhere to**: 坚持 — All employees must adhere to the code of conduct. 所有员工必须遵守行为准则。
- **take advantage of**: 利用 — We should take advantage of this opportunity. 我们应该利用这个机会。
- **be affected by**: 受…影响 — The region was severely affected by the drought. 该地区受到干旱的严重影响。
- **afford to do sth**: 负担得起做某事 — Many families can't afford to buy a house. 许多家庭买不起房子。
- **anticipate doing sth**: 预期做某事 — We anticipate finishing the project next month. 我们预计下个月完成项目。
- **appeal to**: 呼吁；对…有吸引力 — The design appeals to young consumers. 设计对年轻消费者有吸引力。
- **apply for**: 申请 — She applied for a scholarship. 她申请了奖学金。
- **an approach to**: …的方法 — We need a new approach to education. 我们需要一种新的教育方法。
